# What must never be packaged with the chart, even if it is left in its directory: keys, certificates, passphrase
# files, and what generate-mongodbsearch-prerequisites.sh writes. (The script refuses to write inside a chart; this
# is the second guard.)
*.secret.yaml
*.configmap.yaml
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
*.pass
.DS_Store
# Pictures: a chart with the documents' pictures in it (2.7 MB) is refused by `helm install`, "Request entity too
# large": Helm stores the whole chart in the release's record. The documents in docs/ link their pictures instead.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
